{"id":"word:hebrew:H1836","type":"word","title":"דֵּן","subtitle":"H1836 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"this","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to דֵּן (H1836) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: d.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 58 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"דֵּן (dên) means this First listed occurrence: Dan 2 10."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"דֵּן","transliteration":"dên","pronunciation":"dane","strong":"H1836","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1836","partOfSpeech":"d","forms":["דְּנָ֔ה","דְנָ֖ה","דְּנָ֑ה","דְּנָה֙","דְנָה֙"],"morphs":[["APdxms",40],["AC",8],["APdxcs",4],["AR/Pdxms",2],["AC/Pdxms",1],["AC/R/Pdxms",1],["APdxmp",1],["AR/Pdxcs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"this","usage":"(afore-) time, after this manner, here (-after), one...another, such, there(-fore), these, this (matter), thus, where(-fore), which.","full":"H1836. denah דְּנָה 57 demonstrative prounoun common this (Zinjirli זנה זן, ; Egyptian Aramaic זנה (S-C Pap. B 17 +); זנך (ib. C 6, D 8 ); Nabataean, Palmyrene דנה (Lzb 264 Cooke 26 ); דֵּין ᵑ7 (e.g. 1Sam 10:27 ) and (with הָ , i.e. הָא , ecce ) הָדֵתן ; Aramaic of Têma זא הא (Cooke 195. 198 ); Syriac (contracted for הָֽדְנָא ); Mandean האזין ; Sabean (Hom Chrest. 13 ); Ethiopic all from [ דֶּה ,] זה , + demonstrative noun (W CG 108 f. ); feminine Biblical Aramaic הָדה דָּא, ᵑ7 דָּא, , Syriac , Mandean האזא , Ethiopic without the n ; the plural is אִלֵּין , q. v. ); &#8212; this: a. Dan 2:18 דְנָה רָזָא this secret, 2:28 ; 2:29 ; 2:30 +, Ezra 4:11 ; 5:3-4 , 9 +; כָּלדְּֿנָה Dan 5:22 . b. דְנָה אַחֲרֵי after this Dan 2:29 , 45 ; so דְּנָה בָּאתַר 7:6-7 ,. c. כִּדְנָה like this, thus , Jer 10:10 (= Hebrew כֹּה ), Dan 2:10 כִדְנָה מִלְּתָא a word like this (compare כָּזֹאת Est 4:14 ), Esther 3:29; Ezra 5:7 . d. עַלדְּֿנָה on account of this Dan 3:16 ; Ezra 4:22 ; 5:5 , 17 ; 6:11 ; as conjunction = therefore (compare Hebrew עַלזֹֿאת ) 4:14-15 ,. &#8212; See also קֳבֵלַ and קַדְמָה .","rootNote":"(Aramaic) an orthographical variation of 1791 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Dan 2 10","keyReferences":["Dan 2 10","Dan 2 12","Dan 2 18","Dan 2 24","Dan 2 28","Dan 2 29","Dan 2 30","Dan 2 36"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":58,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Dan 2 10","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִ/דְנָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"AR/Pdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 12","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"AC"},{"reference":"Dan 2 18","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 24","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֗ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"AC"},{"reference":"Dan 2 28","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 29","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְנָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 30","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְנָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 36","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 43","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":43,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 43","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":43,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְּנָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 45","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":45,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דְנָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"APdxms"},{"reference":"Dan 2 47","book":"Dan","chapter":2,"verse":47,"englishText":"","so